  "releaseNotes": "* Update ``FilePathResolver`` file resolving code to ensure Target File Path is an Executable File and throw an Exception if it is not (#208 )\n* Updated ``FilePathResolver`` to use DotPrimitives to assist with Path Environment Variable Resolving code (#208)\n* Updated ``FilePathResolver`` logic to use enumerated Path directories method for potential performance improvements\n* Updated code to use Argument Exception throwing polyfills (#210) and address nullability warnings \n* Removed some no longer needed internal Helper code\n* Fixed typos in Localized Exception strings",
